  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Velvet: A Multi-Modal Verifier for Imperative Programs in Lean",
  "excerpt": "Velvet is a Dafny-style verifier for imperative programs embedded in the Lean proof assistant. Velvet seamlessly combines SMT-inspired proof automation with Lean's interactive proof mode, enabling multi-modal verification: programs can be compiled, executed, validated using property-based testing, and formally verified within one unified environment."
